{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"中心扩张"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"中心扩张"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>抽象</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"群","text":"群"}},{"Plain":"的中心扩张是群的"},{"Local":{"url":"群短正合列","text":"短正合列"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nA \\to G' \\to G,\r\n$$\n带有 $A$ 上的 $\\mathbb E_2$-群结构, 以及一个映射\n$$\r\n\\mathbf{B}G \\to \\mathbf{B}^2 A,\r\n$$\n使得有如下"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维列","text":"纤维列"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    A&amp;\\to G' \\to G\\\\\r\n    \\to \\mathbf{B}A&amp;\\to \\mathbf{B}G' \\to \\mathbf{B}G\\\\\r\n    \\to\\mathbf{B}^2 A.\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}